    end

    record SimulateCustomPolicyInput
        -- A list of policy documents to include in the simulation. Each document is specified as
        -- a string containing the complete, valid JSON text of an IAM policy. Do not include any
        -- resource-based policies in this parameter. Any resource-based policy must be submitted
        -- with the ResourcePolicy parameter. The policies cannot be "scope-down"
        -- policies, such as you could include in a call to GetFederationToken or one of
        -- the AssumeRole API operations. In other words, do not use policies designed to
